category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Portable NetBSD-compatibility library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libnbcompat is a portable NetBSD-compatibility library that supplies routines
used by NetBSD bootstrap tools that are missing on other operating systems."
